(Retrieval augmented generation works in three stages. First, documents are) Tj
T*
(split into overlapping chunks. Second, each chunk is embedded into a vector and) Tj
T*
(stored in a database. Third, at query time the user question is embedded and the) Tj
T*
(most similar chunks are retrieved and passed to the language model as context.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
